\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Beamformer architecture. Two-microphone STFT feeds are used to estimate the spatial covariance $\hat  {\mathbf  {R}}_{xx}(k)$ and compute MVDR weights $\mathbf  {w}(k)$ with diagonal loading. The steered beamformer output $Y_{k,n}$ is further refined by a Zelinski-style Wiener post-filter that exploits inter-channel coherence to suppress residual diffuse noise.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
